  "The problem, in one sentence": "Problemet i én sætning",
  "The repository is public, and GitHub does not charge public repositories for hosting or standard Actions runners.": "Repositoryet er offentligt, og GitHub opkræver ikke betaling for hosting eller standardkørsler med Actions i offentlige repositories.",
  "The session is booked": "Samtalen er bestilt",
  "The session is confirmed and Dev's $150 is held. It is released to Margaret once the session has taken place. In this prototype the payment is simulated.": "Samtalen er bekræftet, og Devs 150 $ tilbageholdes. De udbetales til Margaret efter samtalen. I prototypen er betalingen simuleret.",
  "The session with Dev has happened. The agent asks Margaret how she thinks, so her engine can learn it.": "Samtalen med Dev er afholdt. Agenten spørger Margaret, hvordan hun tænker, så motoren kan lære det.",
  "The three conversations are generated live{0}. Their text is sent to OpenAI through the ChatGPT account signed in to Codex on this computer. No API key is used.": "De tre samtaler genereres live{0}. Teksten sendes til OpenAI via den ChatGPT-konto, der er logget ind i Codex på denne computer. Ingen API-nøgle bruges.",
  "The two of them agree the details. Nothing is booked until Margaret accepts.": "De aftaler detaljerne indbyrdes. Intet bestilles, før Margaret accepterer.",
  "The two of them settle the details between themselves. The price has to sit inside the overlap, and nothing is booked or charged until Margaret accepts.": "De aftaler detaljerne indbyrdes. Prisen skal ligge i det fælles interval, og intet bestilles eller opkræves, før Margaret accepterer.",
  "The typical expert earns $150 or more a week": "Den typiske ekspert tjener mindst 150 $ om ugen",
  "The walkthrough uses the scripted conversations.": "Gennemgangen bruger de forberedte samtaler.",
  "Then": "Derefter",
  "There is no form to fill in and no profile to write. Margaret talks, by voice or by picking a suggested reply, and an agent turns what she says into a profile.": "Der er ingen formular eller profil at udfylde. Margaret taler eller vælger et foreslået svar, og en agent omsætter hendes ord til en profil.",
  "There is no match to continue with.": "Der er intet match at fortsætte med.",
  "There is no match to send a proposal to.": "Der er intet match at sende et forslag til.",
  "They agree on a session": "De aftaler en samtale",
  "They draft and suggest. They never decide.": "De laver udkast og foreslår. De beslutter aldrig.",
  "Thirty minutes would do. Somewhere between fifty and a hundred dollars per fifteen minutes.": "Tredive minutter er nok. Mellem halvtreds og hundrede dollars pr. femten minutter.",
  "Thirty-four years in procurement, twelve of them as a director, puts you in the top band for this kind of advice.": "Fireogtredive år med indkøb, tolv som direktør, placerer dig i den høje ende for denne slags hjælp.",
  "This conversation stands in for a voice interview.": "Denne samtale repræsenterer et stemmeinterview.",
  "This is the end of the walkthrough.": "Her slutter gennemgangen.",
